Z||000000||Loki||10-22-2001||06:16 PM||||Well, im looking at a 50gal for my very first tank. And well dont know jack about fish   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Anyone got any pointers?hehe  <BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://members.home.net/fieroloki/loki_sig.gif">    <IMG SRC="http://members.home.net/fieroloki/w4[1].gif"> <BR>ICQ# 16477998||||reg||1
Z||000001||Simple Fiero||10-22-2001||07:01 PM||||Number one 50 gallon is a great starter tank, if things go wrong it gives you some time to fix it.<BR>and check out the forums and all the stuff on <A HREF="http://www.fishindex.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fishindex.com</A> <BR>they are great and willing to help a newbie.<BR>But first you have to decide what you are going to raise.<BR>I have 3 tanks<BR>a 20 gallon african cichlid tank, a 33 gallon freshwater and a 2 gallon goldfish and I love them all but problem is money goes into them and not my car LOL!<BR>Study what type you want and then what fish, with a 50 gallon you have a ton of options. And the it doesn't have the be a deep tank a wide tank is better(but hard to come by)<BR>Anyhoo good luck and tell me what you decide on I am really interested. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Later<BR>Craig||||reg||12
Z||000002||Loki||10-22-2001||07:06 PM||||Cool, thanx. I dont rememeber the name of the fish but the guy I talked to said they were an aggressive fish. Pretty for freshwater, which is a plus   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  They have the compltete set up.tank, canope, stand and all stuff to add water and go for $800  so I think im gonna make my own stand    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> (was 200 itself)<BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://members.home.net/fieroloki/loki_sig.gif">    <IMG SRC="http://members.home.net/fieroloki/w4[1].gif"> <BR>ICQ# 16477998||||reg||1
Z||000003||Jake_Dragon||10-22-2001||07:33 PM||||Will you fit in a 50 gal tank? You definitely don't want any aggressive fish in there when you do get into it.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by Jake_Dragon (edited 10-22-2001).]||||reg||1
